# UI

Light is locked. `color-scheme: only light`. Cool silver `--paper`, white `--surface`, ink CTAs. Do not add `prefers-color-scheme: dark`.

Outfit is the product face. Martian Mono is only for pairing codes, fingerprints, and the 12 words. Sheets use `--radius` and `--shadow`. Hover is `--wash`, not a full invert. Press uses `scale(0.98)`.

The signed-out home is an asymmetric split: headline left, demo sheet right. No hero glow, mesh, or beam.

First-run is one visible next action. The signed-out hero has one CTA. A guest without an invite is told they need a link. After a passkey, the 12 words are generated on that screen with a working label. Pairing is not a peer of invite redeem. An empty browser only offers Show a code. The working device types that code or scans the QR. Pair and Scan live in the signed-in top bar. Forget is visible on every width. Invites are `/join?t=` URLs. Do not say “vault” on a screen a guest has to complete. ⌘K is not required to finish setup.

Never Inter. No emoji chrome. Do not imply the server reads plaintext.
